      "message": "fix(ui): lock the last unguarded GPU tests of the egui_app and lib binaries\n\nThree headless tests of tests/egui_app.rs and three ignored pixel snapshot\ntests made wgpu devices without gpu_guard. Put them under the guard and pin\nthe two sets in gpu_test_lock.\n\nFixes #3379\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
